sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CPU as CPU
    participant Pin as Pinned host memory
    participant PCIe as PCIe
    participant GPU as GPU
    CPU->>Pin: stage the batch in page-locked memory
    Note over Pin: pageable memory forces the driver to bounce through a staging buffer first
    CPU->>PCIe: async copy on a stream
    PCIe->>GPU: DMA, no CPU involvement
    par overlap
        CPU->>CPU: prepare the next batch
        GPU->>GPU: compute the current one
    end
    GPU->>PCIe: results back
    Note over CPU,GPU: keep both busy — a CPU waiting on the GPU is half your machine idle
